<rml>
<head>
	<title>Skirmish</title>
	<link type="text/rcss" href="../rcss/menu.rcss"/>
	<link type="text/rcss" href="../rcss/match.rcss"/>
</head>
<!--
Skirmish (CreateMatchPage.tsx's OfflineBotsPage with MapBrowser.tsx): a mod, a mode, an arena, how many
bots and their skill. Its state is create_match.skirmish, the map browser's create_match_pick.skirmish
(fit: the mode's map type, mapi: the arena's index in the engine's maps, racei: the race map's in
skirmish_races), in ui/data/create_match.json, and skirmish.* (oz_ui_skirmish.cpp).

Mod: the tabs, Oz Arena, CPMA and Defrag, the ones the player has (Q and E switch them). A mod that's
in the install where a switch to it doesn't look (Defrag's bundle) shows the import box, as the Server
Browser's. Under Oz and CPMA the map browser lists the arenas; under Defrag the race maps (oz_races.c),
with Oz's estimate of how hard each is, and Fight races the picked one (the race action): Defrag's
game, its own timer, no bots.

The cards are the views' (skirmish_view: v.i is the arena's index in maps, v.show whether the search
shows it, v.fits the modes it's made for; skirmish_rview the same for skirmish_races): the search box
and the sort chips change the views' values in C++ (oz_ui_skirmish.cpp), never the cards. A card's id
is sk_map_<map> (sk_other_<map> in the second list, sk_user_<map> under User generated, sk_race_<map>
for a race). The map browser lists the player's own maps first, under User generated (maps[].user:
the map editor's compiles, oz_ui_menu.cpp; shown while skirmish.user_shown, the ones the search finds,
is above 0; picking one made for other modes than the mode's switches to the first it's made for),
then the arenas made for the mode, then the ones made for the other modes (picking one of those
switches to the first mode it's made for). A mode change keeps the arena when it's made for the new
mode, else picks the mode's own (modes[].pick): the arrows and the value run that themselves, Left and
Right spin in C++ and the key's release checks. RmlUi's expressions have no loops, so the checks over an arena's types (up
to six) are written out; they were generated, so keep their shape.

Fight: the button's click works out the lineup, the fight wrapper's click (after it, as the click
bubbles) starts the match with startmatch create_match.skirmish (its mod too: CPMA's game plays it),
puts you in a team in the team modes (q3_ui's "team"), and sets back the cvars a custom match may have
changed. The lineup is the arena's own bots (arenas.txt), then the engine's bots in their order,
skipping the arena's, up to the count (one in a duel): k0..k6 are the arena's bots in lower case, d is
whether bots[j] is one of them, c how many of the first j were, and bots.m0..m6, f0..f17 are the names
startmatch adds ('' is no bot).
-->
<body data-model="menu">
	<div class="panel">
		<div class="corners"><div class="tl"/><div class="tr"/><div class="bl"/><div class="br"/></div>
		<div class="topline"/>
		<div class="phead">
			<div><banner text="Skirmish"/>
				<p class="subtitle" data-if="skirmish.mod == 'oz'">Pick a mode and an arena; the map's own bots come first, as in the original game's single-player tiers.</p>
				<p class="subtitle" data-if="skirmish.mod == 'cpma'">The same bot match, played under your CPMA: its own game decides the movement and the rules.</p>
				<p class="subtitle" data-if="skirmish.mod == 'defrag'">Race a map under your Defrag: its own game runs the race and times it, with no bots. Leaving the match brings you back to Oz.</p>
			</div>
			<div class="backbtn" onclick="back"><kbd>Esc</kbd><span>Back</span></div>
		</div>
		<div class="divider"/>
		<div class="pbody">
			<div class="cols">
				<div class="main">
					<div class="browser">
						<div class="tabs sktabs nokeys">
							<button id="sk_mod_oz" class="tab" data-class-active="skirmish.mod == 'oz'" data-event-click="skirmish.mod = 'oz'"><span>Oz Arena</span><span class="under"/></button>
							<button id="sk_mod_cpma" class="tab" data-if="skirmish.have.cpma.state != 'none'" data-class-active="skirmish.mod == 'cpma'" data-event-click="skirmish.mod = 'cpma'"><span>CPMA</span><span class="under"/></button>
							<button id="sk_mod_defrag" class="tab" data-if="skirmish.have.defrag.state != 'none'" data-class-active="skirmish.mod == 'defrag'" data-event-click="skirmish.mod = 'defrag'"><span>Defrag</span><span class="under"/></button>
						</div>
						<div class="mbar">
							<input id="sk_search" class="text search" type="text" maxlength="64" placeholder="Search maps" data-value="skirmish.q"/>
							<button id="sk_sort_order" class="chip" data-if="skirmish.mod != 'defrag'" data-class-on="skirmish.sort == 'order'" data-event-click="skirmish.sort = 'order'"><span>Game order</span></button>
							<button id="sk_sort_easy" class="chip" data-if="skirmish.mod == 'defrag'" data-class-on="skirmish.sort == 'easy'" data-event-click="skirmish.sort = 'easy'"><span>Easiest first</span></button>
							<button id="sk_sort_hard" class="chip" data-if="skirmish.mod == 'defrag'" data-class-on="skirmish.sort == 'hard'" data-event-click="skirmish.sort = 'hard'"><span>Hardest first</span></button>
							<button id="sk_sort_name" class="chip" data-class-on="skirmish.sort == 'name'" data-event-click="skirmish.sort = 'name'"><span>Name</span></button>
							<span class="hint">{{ skirmish.shown == skirmish.count ? skirmish.count + (skirmish.mod == 'defrag' ? ' race maps' : ' arenas') : skirmish.shown + ' of ' + skirmish.count }}</span>
						</div>
						<div class="cards" data-if="skirmish.mod != 'defrag'">
							<div data-if="skirmish.mod == 'oz' &amp;&amp; skirmish.user_shown &gt; 0">
								<div class="othersh usersh">User generated: the maps you compiled in the map editor</div>
								<div class="grid">
									<button class="card" data-for="v : skirmish_view" data-if="v.show ? maps[v.i].user : false" data-attr-id="'sk_user_' + maps[v.i].map" data-class-sel="v.i == create_match_pick.skirmish.mapi" data-attrif-autofocus="v.i == create_match_pick.skirmish.mapi" data-event-click="create_match_pick.skirmish.mapi = v.i; create_match.skirmish.mi = (maps[v.i].types.size &gt; 0 ? (maps[v.i].types[0] == create_match_pick.skirmish.fit ? true : (maps[v.i].types.size &gt; 1 ? (maps[v.i].types[1] == create_match_pick.skirmish.fit ? true : (maps[v.i].types.size &gt; 2 ? (maps[v.i].types[2] == create_match_pick.skirmish.fit ? true : (maps[v.i].types.size &gt; 3 ? (maps[v.i].types[3] == create_match_pick.skirmish.fit ? true : (maps[v.i].types.size &gt; 4 ? (maps[v.i].types[4] == create_match_pick.skirmish.fit ? true : (maps[v.i].types.size &gt; 5 ? (maps[v.i].types[5] == create_match_pick.skirmish.fit ? true : false) : false)) : false)) : false)) : false)) : false)) : false) ? create_match.skirmish.mi : ((maps[v.i].types.size &gt; 0 ? (maps[v.i].types[0] == 'ffa' ? true : (maps[v.i].types.size &gt; 1 ? (maps[v.i].types[1] == 'ffa' ? true : (maps[v.i].types.size &gt; 2 ? (maps[v.i].types[2] == 'ffa' ? true : (maps[v.i].types.size &gt; 3 ? (maps[v.i].types[3] == 'ffa' ? true : (maps[v.i].types.size &gt; 4 ? (maps[v.i].types[4] == 'ffa' ? true : (maps[v.i].types.size &gt; 5 ? (maps[v.i].types[5] == 'ffa' ? true : false) : false)) : false)) : false)) : false)) : false)) : false) ? 0 : (maps[v.i].types.size &gt; 0 ? (maps[v.i].types[0] == 'tourney' ? true : (maps[v.i].types.size &gt; 1 ? (maps[v.i].types[1] == 'tourney' ? true : (maps[v.i].types.size &gt; 2 ? (maps[v.i].types[2] == 'tourney' ? true : (maps[v.i].types.size &gt; 3 ? (maps[v.i].types[3] == 'tourney' ? true : (maps[v.i].types.size &gt; 4 ? (maps[v.i].types[4] == 'tourney' ? true : (maps[v.i].types.size &gt; 5 ? (maps[v.i].types[5] == 'tourney' ? true : false) : false)) : false)) : false)) : false)) : false)) : false) ? 1 : (maps[v.i].types.size &gt; 0 ? (maps[v.i].types[0] == 'team' ? true : (maps[v.i].types.size &gt; 1 ? (maps[v.i].types[1] == 'team' ? true : (maps[v.i].types.size &gt; 2 ? (maps[v.i].types[2] == 'team' ? true : (maps[v.i].types.size &gt; 3 ? (maps[v.i].types[3] == 'team' ? true : (maps[v.i].types.size &gt; 4 ? (maps[v.i].types[4] == 'team' ? true : (maps[v.i].types.size &gt; 5 ? (maps[v.i].types[5] == 'team' ? true : false) : false)) : false)) : false)) : false)) : false)) : false) ? 2 : 3); create_match_pick.skirmish.fit = create_match.modes[create_match.skirmish.mi].fit">
										<div class="img" data-style-decorator="'linear-gradient(0deg, #000000e6 0%, #00000033 50%, #00000000 100%)' + (maps[v.i].tile != '' ? ', image(' + maps[v.i].tile + ' fill)' : '')"/>
										<div class="fits" data-if="maps[v.i].nobots"><span>No bots</span></div>
										<div class="cap"><div class="n">{{ maps[v.i].name | plain }}</div><div class="id">{{ maps[v.i].map }}</div></div>
									</button>
								</div>
								<div class="othersh">Arenas made for {{ create_match.modes[create_match.skirmish.mi].name }}</div>
							</div>
							<div class="grid">
								<button class="card" data-for="v : skirmish_view" data-if="v.show ? (maps[v.i].user ? false : (maps[v.i].types.size &gt; 0 ? (maps[v.i].types[0] == create_match_pick.skirmish.fit ? true : (maps[v.i].types.size &gt; 1 ? (maps[v.i].types[1] == create_match_pick.skirmish.fit ? true : (maps[v.i].types.size &gt; 2 ? (maps[v.i].types[2] == create_match_pick.skirmish.fit ? true : (maps[v.i].types.size &gt; 3 ? (maps[v.i].types[3] == create_match_pick.skirmish.fit ? true : (maps[v.i].types.size &gt; 4 ? (maps[v.i].types[4] == create_match_pick.skirmish.fit ? true : (maps[v.i].types.size &gt; 5 ? (maps[v.i].types[5] == create_match_pick.skirmish.fit ? true : false) : false)) : false)) : false)) : false)) : false)) : false)) : false" data-attr-id="'sk_map_' + maps[v.i].map" data-class-sel="v.i == create_match_pick.skirmish.mapi" data-attrif-autofocus="v.i == create_match_pick.skirmish.mapi" data-event-click="create_match_pick.skirmish.mapi = v.i">
									<div class="img" data-style-decorator="'linear-gradient(0deg, #000000e6 0%, #00000033 50%, #00000000 100%)' + (maps[v.i].tile != '' ? ', image(' + maps[v.i].tile + ' fill)' : '')"/>
									<div class="cap"><div class="n">{{ maps[v.i].name | plain }}</div><div class="id">{{ maps[v.i].map }}</div></div>
								</button>
							</div>
							<div class="othersh">Made for other modes than {{ create_match.modes[create_match.skirmish.mi].name }}: picking one switches the mode</div>
							<div class="grid">
								<button class="card" data-for="v : skirmish_view" data-if="v.show ? (maps[v.i].user ? false : ((maps[v.i].types.size &gt; 0 ? (maps[v.i].types[0] == create_match_pick.skirmish.fit ? true : (maps[v.i].types.size &gt; 1 ? (maps[v.i].types[1] == create_match_pick.skirmish.fit ? true : (maps[v.i].types.size &gt; 2 ? (maps[v.i].types[2] == create_match_pick.skirmish.fit ? true : (maps[v.i].types.size &gt; 3 ? (maps[v.i].types[3] == create_match_pick.skirmish.fit ? true : (maps[v.i].types.size &gt; 4 ? (maps[v.i].types[4] == create_match_pick.skirmish.fit ? true : (maps[v.i].types.size &gt; 5 ? (maps[v.i].types[5] == create_match_pick.skirmish.fit ? true : false) : false)) : false)) : false)) : false)) : false)) : false) ? false : (maps[v.i].types.size &gt; 0 ? (maps[v.i].types[0] == 'ffa' || maps[v.i].types[0] == 'tourney' || maps[v.i].types[0] == 'team' || maps[v.i].types[0] == 'ctf' ? true : (maps[v.i].types.size &gt; 1 ? (maps[v.i].types[1] == 'ffa' || maps[v.i].types[1] == 'tourney' || maps[v.i].types[1] == 'team' || maps[v.i].types[1] == 'ctf' ? true : (maps[v.i].types.size &gt; 2 ? (maps[v.i].types[2] == 'ffa' || maps[v.i].types[2] == 'tourney' || maps[v.i].types[2] == 'team' || maps[v.i].types[2] == 'ctf' ? true : (maps[v.i].types.size &gt; 3 ? (maps[v.i].types[3] == 'ffa' || maps[v.i].types[3] == 'tourney' || maps[v.i].types[3] == 'team' || maps[v.i].types[3] == 'ctf' ? true : (maps[v.i].types.size &gt; 4 ? (maps[v.i].types[4] == 'ffa' || maps[v.i].types[4] == 'tourney' || maps[v.i].types[4] == 'team' || maps[v.i].types[4] == 'ctf' ? true : (maps[v.i].types.size &gt; 5 ? (maps[v.i].types[5] == 'ffa' || maps[v.i].types[5] == 'tourney' || maps[v.i].types[5] == 'team' || maps[v.i].types[5] == 'ctf' ? true : false) : false)) : false)) : false)) : false)) : false)) : false))) : false" data-attr-id="'sk_other_' + maps[v.i].map" data-class-sel="v.i == create_match_pick.skirmish.mapi" data-attrif-autofocus="v.i == create_match_pick.skirmish.mapi" data-event-click="create_match_pick.skirmish.mapi = v.i; create_match.skirmish.mi = (maps[v.i].types.size &gt; 0 ? (maps[v.i].types[0] == 'ffa' ? true : (maps[v.i].types.size &gt; 1 ? (maps[v.i].types[1] == 'ffa' ? true : (maps[v.i].types.size &gt; 2 ? (maps[v.i].types[2] == 'ffa' ? true : (maps[v.i].types.size &gt; 3 ? (maps[v.i].types[3] == 'ffa' ? true : (maps[v.i].types.size &gt; 4 ? (maps[v.i].types[4] == 'ffa' ? true : (maps[v.i].types.size &gt; 5 ? (maps[v.i].types[5] == 'ffa' ? true : false) : false)) : false)) : false)) : false)) : false)) : false) ? 0 : (maps[v.i].types.size &gt; 0 ? (maps[v.i].types[0] == 'tourney' ? true : (maps[v.i].types.size &gt; 1 ? (maps[v.i].types[1] == 'tourney' ? true : (maps[v.i].types.size &gt; 2 ? (maps[v.i].types[2] == 'tourney' ? true : (maps[v.i].types.size &gt; 3 ? (maps[v.i].types[3] == 'tourney' ? true : (maps[v.i].types.size &gt; 4 ? (maps[v.i].types[4] == 'tourney' ? true : (maps[v.i].types.size &gt; 5 ? (maps[v.i].types[5] == 'tourney' ? true : false) : false)) : false)) : false)) : false)) : false)) : false) ? 1 : (maps[v.i].types.size &gt; 0 ? (maps[v.i].types[0] == 'team' ? true : (maps[v.i].types.size &gt; 1 ? (maps[v.i].types[1] == 'team' ? true : (maps[v.i].types.size &gt; 2 ? (maps[v.i].types[2] == 'team' ? true : (maps[v.i].types.size &gt; 3 ? (maps[v.i].types[3] == 'team' ? true : (maps[v.i].types.size &gt; 4 ? (maps[v.i].types[4] == 'team' ? true : (maps[v.i].types.size &gt; 5 ? (maps[v.i].types[5] == 'team' ? true : false) : false)) : false)) : false)) : false)) : false)) : false) ? 2 : 3; create_match_pick.skirmish.fit = create_match.modes[create_match.skirmish.mi].fit">
									<div class="img" data-style-decorator="'linear-gradient(0deg, #000000e6 0%, #00000033 50%, #00000000 100%)' + (maps[v.i].tile != '' ? ', image(' + maps[v.i].tile + ' fill)' : '')"/>
									<div class="fits"><span data-for="t : v.fits">{{ t }}</span></div>
									<div class="cap"><div class="n">{{ maps[v.i].name | plain }}</div><div class="id">{{ maps[v.i].map }}</div></div>
								</button>
							</div>
							<p class="nomaps" data-if="skirmish.shown == 0">No arena's name or file name has "{{ skirmish.q }}".</p>
						</div>
						<div class="cards" data-if="skirmish.mod == 'defrag'">
							<div class="grid">
								<button class="card" data-for="r : skirmish_rview" data-if="r.show" data-attr-id="'sk_race_' + skirmish_races[r.i].map" data-class-sel="r.i == create_match_pick.skirmish.racei" data-attrif-autofocus="r.i == create_match_pick.skirmish.racei" data-event-click="create_match_pick.skirmish.racei = r.i">
									<div class="img" data-style-decorator="'linear-gradient(0deg, #000000e6 0%, #00000033 50%, #00000000 100%)' + (skirmish_races[r.i].tile != '' ? ', image(' + skirmish_races[r.i].tile + ' fill)' : '')"/>
									<div class="fits"><span class="lvl" data-class-easy="skirmish_races[r.i].level &lt; 3" data-class-hard="skirmish_races[r.i].level &gt; 3">{{ skirmish_races[r.i].word }}</span></div>
									<div class="cap"><div class="n">{{ skirmish_races[r.i].title }}</div><div class="id">{{ skirmish_races[r.i].map }}</div></div>
								</button>
							</div>
							<p class="nomaps" data-if="skirmish_scan.empty != ''">{{ skirmish_scan.empty }}</p>
							<p class="looking" data-if="skirmish_scan.empty == '' &amp;&amp; skirmish_scan.text != ''">{{ skirmish_scan.text }}</p>
						</div>
					</div>
				</div>
				<div class="side skside">
					<div class="preview" data-if="skirmish.mod != 'defrag'">
						<div data-if="maps.size &gt; create_match_pick.skirmish.mapi">
							<div class="img" data-style-decorator="maps[create_match_pick.skirmish.mapi].shot != '' ? 'image(' + maps[create_match_pick.skirmish.mapi].shot + ' fill)' : 'none'"/>
							<div class="fade"/>
							<div class="cap"><div class="n">{{ maps[create_match_pick.skirmish.mapi].name | plain }}</div><div class="id">{{ maps[create_match_pick.skirmish.mapi].map }}</div></div>
						</div>
					</div>
					<div class="preview" data-if="skirmish.mod == 'defrag'">
						<div data-if="skirmish_race.map != ''">
							<div class="img" data-style-decorator="skirmish_race.shot != '' ? 'image(' + skirmish_race.shot + ' fill)' : 'none'"/>
							<div class="fade"/>
							<div class="cap"><div class="n">{{ skirmish_race.title }}</div><div class="id">{{ skirmish_race.map }}</div></div>
						</div>
					</div>
					<div class="modimport" data-if="!skirmish.ready">
						<p>Your {{ skirmish.mod_name }} is one folder deeper than the game loads a mod from ({{ skirmish.found }}). Import copies it into your Oz folder; nothing is downloaded.</p>
						<button id="sk_import" class="btn" onclick="skimport"><span>Import from your game</span></button>
						<p class="msg" data-if="skirmish.import_message != ''">{{ skirmish.import_message }}</p>
					</div>
					<div data-if="skirmish.mod != 'defrag'">
						<div class="section"><span class="t">Mode</span><span class="rule"/></div>
						<div id="sk_mode" class="spinner wide modespin" spin="create_match.skirmish.mi" options="0|1|2|3" data-event-keyup="create_match_pick.skirmish.fit = create_match.modes[create_match.skirmish.mi].fit; create_match_pick.skirmish.mapi = (maps.size &gt; create_match_pick.skirmish.mapi ? (maps[create_match_pick.skirmish.mapi].types.size &gt; 0 ? (maps[create_match_pick.skirmish.mapi].types[0] == create_match_pick.skirmish.fit ? true : (maps[create_match_pick.skirmish.mapi].types.size &gt; 1 ? (maps[create_match_pick.skirmish.mapi].types[1] == create_match_pick.skirmish.fit ? true : (maps[create_match_pick.skirmish.mapi].types.size &gt; 2 ? (maps[create_match_pick.skirmish.mapi].types[2] == create_match_pick.skirmish.fit ? true : (maps[create_match_pick.skirmish.mapi].types.size &gt; 3 ? (maps[create_match_pick.skirmish.mapi].types[3] == create_match_pick.skirmish.fit ? true : (maps[create_match_pick.skirmish.mapi].types.size &gt; 4 ? (maps[create_match_pick.skirmish.mapi].types[4] == create_match_pick.skirmish.fit ? true : (maps[create_match_pick.skirmish.mapi].types.size &gt; 5 ? (maps[create_match_pick.skirmish.mapi].types[5] == create_match_pick.skirmish.fit ? true : false) : false)) : false)) : false)) : false)) : false)) : false) : false) ? create_match_pick.skirmish.mapi : create_match.modes[create_match.skirmish.mi].pick">
							<span class="arrow" onclick="sound move" data-event-click="create_match.skirmish.mi = create_match.skirmish.mi &gt; 0 ? create_match.skirmish.mi - 1 : 3; create_match_pick.skirmish.fit = create_match.modes[create_match.skirmish.mi].fit; create_match_pick.skirmish.mapi = (maps.size &gt; create_match_pick.skirmish.mapi ? (maps[create_match_pick.skirmish.mapi].types.size &gt; 0 ? (maps[create_match_pick.skirmish.mapi].types[0] == create_match_pick.skirmish.fit ? true : (maps[create_match_pick.skirmish.mapi].types.size &gt; 1 ? (maps[create_match_pick.skirmish.mapi].types[1] == create_match_pick.skirmish.fit ? true : (maps[create_match_pick.skirmish.mapi].types.size &gt; 2 ? (maps[create_match_pick.skirmish.mapi].types[2] == create_match_pick.skirmish.fit ? true : (maps[create_match_pick.skirmish.mapi].types.size &gt; 3 ? (maps[create_match_pick.skirmish.mapi].types[3] == create_match_pick.skirmish.fit ? true : (maps[create_match_pick.skirmish.mapi].types.size &gt; 4 ? (maps[create_match_pick.skirmish.mapi].types[4] == create_match_pick.skirmish.fit ? true : (maps[create_match_pick.skirmish.mapi].types.size &gt; 5 ? (maps[create_match_pick.skirmish.mapi].types[5] == create_match_pick.skirmish.fit ? true : false) : false)) : false)) : false)) : false)) : false)) : false) : false) ? create_match_pick.skirmish.mapi : create_match.modes[create_match.skirmish.mi].pick">&lt;</span>
